    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover Ancient Ruins on Frog Island!</h2>Relaxing, cozy casual adventure where your quest is to explore and create a map of the mysterious island. Take a short hike through a magical forest full of frogs and relics from an ancient civilization that worshipped frogs and built large frog statues!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hand crafted magical island!</h2>Take a cozy hike and enjoy the scenery! Unlock the path to four distinctive parts of the Frog Island.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relaxing Adventure in a Mystical World!</h2>Lore of the Frog is a fully positive experience aimed to be a relaxing and cozy casual adventure to lift your mood. The full experience takes between 1,5-2 hours to complete.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Solve casual puzzles to unlock the path through the island<br></li><li>Explore and make a map of the Frog Island<br></li><li>Put hats on frogs!</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Uncover ancient frog ruins<br></li><li>Enjoy a relaxing atmosphere &amp; music<br></li><li>Fill your journal with stickers<br></li><li>Put hats on frogs!</li></ul>",
